s/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.6RC2 (and RC1)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.rc2 - macOS Tahoe (26.2.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Max (Apple7) - Apple M1 Max (10 threads) - 64.00 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen adding an occluder polygon via code launching the game starts and immediately terminates with no errors. The console only reads:\n\n```\nGodot Engine v4.6.rc2.official.78c6632eb - https://godotengine.org\nMetal 4.0 - Forward+ - Using Device #0: Apple - Apple M1 Max (Apple7)\n\n--- Debugging process stopped ---\n```\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nSee included project. When using script:\n\n```\nextends Polygon2D\nclass_name StaticPolygon\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tvar static_body: StaticBody2D = StaticBody2D.new()\n\tvar light_occluder: LightOccluder2D = LightOccluder2D.new()\n\tvar collision_polygon: CollisionPolygon2D = CollisionPolygon2D.new()\n\tvar occluder_polygon: OccluderPolygon2D = OccluderPolygon2D.new()\n\t\n\t\n\tcollision_polygon.polygon = polygon\n\t#occluder_polygon.polygon = polygon\n\t\n\tadd_child(static_body)\n\tadd_child(light_occluder)\n\t\n\tstatic_body.add_child.call_deferred(collision_polygon)\n\tstatic_body.add_child.call_deferred(occluder_polygon)\n\t\n\tlight_occluder.occluder = occluder_polygon\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[4.6-occluder-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24742899/4.6-occluder-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com